OL,3,GNEWSAMum's warning after autistic
OL,4,Atoddler, 3, almost drowned in lake
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother whose autistic three-year-old
OL,7,Fgirl almost drowned in a lake after
OL,8,Frunning off from her home said it was
OL,9,Fheartbreaking to see how quickly people
OL,10,Fcould make cruel judgements about her
OL,11,Fcare.
OL,13,FAyda, who is also non-verbal,
OL,14,Fmiraculously survived after being found
OL,15,Fface down in a lake near her home in
OL,16,FThatto Heath in St Helens in April
OL,17,F2024.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
