OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMum's warning after autistic
OL,4,Atoddler, 3, almost drowned in lake
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer mother Alex Price, 40, said more
OL,7,Fawareness was needed about "autism
OL,8,Felopement", where autistic children
OL,9,Fleave the safety of a responsible
OL,10,Fperson's care or safe area, and how
OL,11,Fcommon it was.
OL,13,F"A lot of people can be quick to call
OL,14,Fit bad parenting or that you weren't
OL,15,Fwatching them or you're not a good
OL,16,Fenough parent - that's not it at all,"
OL,17,Fshe said. "It literally takes a split
OL,18,Fsecond, and it happens a lot."
